OL,3,AWoman told Russell Brand he 'treated
OL,4,Aher like an animal', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FOne of the women who claims Russell
OL,10,FBrand raped her later told him he had
OL,11,F"treated her like an animal", a court
OL,12,Fhas heard.
OL,14,FThe comedian's trial at Southwark Crown
OL,15,FCourt in London has been hearing
OL,16,Frecorded police interviews with a
OL,17,Ffemale complainant, who claims she did
OL,18,Fnot consent to anal sex with him at his
OL,19,Fhouse in 2009.
