OL,3,AWoman told Russell Brand he 'treated
OL,4,Aher like an animal', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrand, 51, denies three charges of
OL,7,Frape, three charges of sexual assault
OL,8,Fand one charge of indecent assault. He
OL,9,Fhas said he has never engaged in
OL,10,Fnon-consensual sexual activity.
